(
    title: "Motocross Racer",
    description: Some("Off-road racing in three events you must qualify through in turn. The Desert Scramble is a run against the clock past cactus, rocks and desert creatures — every collision slows your bike, and too many put you out. The Hill Climb winds up a switchback mountain where control matters more than speed, and the Beach Sprint is a flat-out dash for the championship."),
